## 12. Reporting

### Report Structure
1. Executive Summary (non-technical)
2. Incident Overview (timeline, impact)
3. Technical Analysis (evidence, findings)
4. IOC List (for sharing/detection)
5. Recommendations (remediation, prevention)
6. Appendices (raw data, tool output)

